I come back to my flat from the market.
I put all the groceries in my small kitchen.
I have to make Kande Pohe for Neha and Amit.
I watch the cooking video again on my phone.
I listen carefully to the chef's instructions.
He says in the video, "First, wash the poha."
I take out a large colander.
I put half a kilo of thick poha in it.
I wash the poha well with water.
Then, I leave it aside to soften.
The chef says next, "After that, chop the onions and green chilies."
I finely chop two onions with a knife.
Then I also chop three green chilies carefully.
After this, I take out some raw peanuts in a bowl.
I also keep out mustard seeds and turmeric from the spice box.
Now all the preparation for cooking is complete.
Now I turn on the stove.
